==English==
{{wikipedia|lang=en|Just in Time (disambiguation)}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# At the last [[possible]] [[moment]]; just before or within the assigned time.
#:''I very nearly [[drove into]] the car [[in front]], but thankfully I manged to stop '''just in time'''.''

